    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2021271544589099399",
      "url": "https://x.com/dorisyincpa/status/2021271544589099399",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/dorisyincpa/status/2021271544589099399",
      "text": "GCV Community Education Series #20\n\nFrom Vision to Economy: The Engine of GCV Before Fully OM\n\nDear Global Pioneers,\nRespected GCV Leaders,\nMerchants, Ambassadors, and Friends Around the World,\nToday, I want to speak clearly about economy, market rules, and why partial Pi payments at GCV are the engine of Pi Network before fully Open Mainnet.\nAnd I also want to express my deep gratitude — because what we are witnessing now is historic.\n\n1️⃣ What Is Economy?\nEconomy is not price.\nEconomy is not speculation.\nEconomy is not waiting for exchanges.\nEconomy is production, exchange, and circulation of value.\nIf there is no circulation, there is no economy.\nCurrency is only a tool.\nCirculation is the life.\nIf Pi does not circulate, it remains potential.\nWhen Pi circulates, it becomes economy.\n\n2️⃣ What Are Market Rules?\nMarket rules are universal.\nThe market runs on:\nMutual benefit\nIncentives\nSupply and demand\nFirst-mover advantage\nVisibility creates traffic\nTraffic creates revenue\nThe market does not run on emotions.\nIt runs on benefits.\nIf participation creates benefit, people join.\nIf it does not, people leave.\nVery simple.\n\n3️⃣ Why I Advocate Partial Pi Payments at GCV Before Fully OM\nSome pioneers say:\n“Let us wait for fully OM.”\nBut waiting is not economic behavior.\nPartial Pi payment means:\nPart fiat\nPart Pi at GCV\nReal goods\nReal services\nReal transactions\nThis creates real circulation.\nValue is not announced.\nValue is practiced.\nWhen pioneers use Pi in partial payments, we create:\nDemand\nConfidence\nMerchant incentive\nReal use cases\nThis is how economy begins.\nBefore fully OM, we build internal strength.\nWe activate the engine.\n\nPartial Pi payment GCV is a step toward full Pi GCV. This is only a stage, not our destination. Partial Pi payment GCV is the bridge to help us reach full Pi payment, and it can make liquidity from Pi to FIAT happen safely and sustainably. I know many pioneers don't want this process but want Pi to FIAT right now. This is like building a 3-story house but not wanting the first floor. It will collapse if there is no first floor. What we do now is to make the 3rd floor strong.\n\n4️⃣ Why GCV Education Is Critical\nWithout education, pioneers only ask:\n“When can I cash out?”\nBut currency is not designed only to be sold.\nCurrency is designed to circulate.\nIf everyone waits to sell, who will buy?\nIf everyone waits for external validation, who builds internal value?\nGCV education transforms mindset:\nFrom holders\nto builders.\nFrom spectators\nto participants.\nThat mindset is the foundation of long-term success.\n\n5️⃣ Why Partial Pi Payment Is the Engine\nWe have tens of millions of pioneers worldwide.\nIf even a small percentage:\nBuy coffee\nUse services\nShop with partial Pi\nWe instantly create:\nMarket demand\nMerchant incentive\nSocial proof\nEconomic activity\nThis becomes a self-sustaining engine.\nNot theory.\nNot dream.\nReal circulation.\nAnd circulation creates confidence.\nConfidence attracts more participation.\nThis is market law.\n\n6️⃣ Why Businesses Will Not Reject This Model\nLet us think like business owners.\nEvery business has one major headache:\nAdvertising cost.\nAdvertising is expensive.\nSmall businesses suffer the most.\nEven when they can afford ads, there is no guarantee of customers.\nNow imagine:\nThey accept partial Pi payment at GCV.\nThey enter a global community.\nTheir brand is seen by pioneers worldwide.\nEarly adopters gain first-mover advantage.\nAt early stage:\nHigh visibility\nLess competition\nStrong positioning\nWhy would a smart entrepreneur reject that?\nThey won’t.\nBecause this follows market rules.\nMutual benefit.\n\n7️⃣ From Community Movement to Real Business World\nAnd today, I am very happy.\nBecause our GCV movement has transformed.\nIt is no longer only a community movement.\nIt is entering the real business world.\nWe are seeing:\nProfessional merchant advertisements\nReal transaction models\nStrategic promotion\nBusiness mindset\nThis is maturity.\nThis is evolution.\nThis is economic structure forming.\n\n8️⃣ Global Contribution and Leadership\nOf course, we have amazing merchants and pioneers in:\nThailand\nVietnam\nPhilippines\nIndonesia\nMalaysia\nCameroon\nIvory Coast\nBenin\nBangladesh\nArab regions\nand other countries maybe I didn't mention\nAll contributing strongly.\n\nAnd I am especially happy to see India merchants.\nIn only one year, they moved with passion and professionalism.\nThey understand advertisement logic.\nThey understand market timing.\nThey act fast.\nThis is economic intelligence.\n\nThanks to the exceptional leadership and dedication of India Head of GCV Ambassador Mr. Raaj Shama and Global GCV Community India Partner Mr. Issack Bester, together with all India GCV Ambassadors, GCV Special Envoys, GCV Community leaders, merchants, and pioneers for their contributions.\n\n9️⃣ Gratitude to Our Global Leaders\nI sincerely thank:\nInternational GCV Industry Alliance Chair\nMs. Lumari\nVice Chair\nMr. Jojo\nGCV Community Alliance Diplomat\nMs. Nonny Padja\ngreat leadership and hardworking.\nAnd all Global GCV Ambassadors and Special Envoys\nfor your hardworking and extraordinary dedication to Pi Network’s long-term vision.\nYou are building bridges between:\nCommunity and industry\nVision and practice\nConsensus and circulation\nThis is leadership.\nThis is responsibility.\nThis is history in progress.\n\n🔟 Final Message\nI do not advocate partial Pi payment emotionally.\nI advocate it based on:\nEconomic principles.\nMarket rules.\nIncentive structures.\nFirst-mover advantage.\nReal business logic.\nIf we want Pi Network to succeed,\nWe must behave like an economy.\nNot like spectators.\nDo not wait for the engine.\nBe the engine.\nCirculation creates value.\nParticipation creates economy.\nEconomy creates strength.\nAnd strength builds the future.\nThank you.\nLet us continue with confidence, unity, and professionalism.\nThe real business world has already begun.\n\nDoris Yin 🪷🪷🪷\nFounder, Global GCV Movement\nFeb. 10th 2026",
